    "In the Immich web UI, open Account Settings > API Keys and create a key with asset.read, asset.view, person.read and album.read. To make changes and share originals too, give it all permissions. The key is kept in the keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Immich 網頁的「帳號設定 > API 金鑰」建立新金鑰，權限勾選 asset.read、asset.view、person.read 和 album.read。若也要修改內容或分享原始檔，請勾選全部權限。金鑰存在鑰匙圈裡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Immich 网页的“账户设置 > API 密钥”中创建新密钥，权限勾选 asset.read、asset.view、person.read 和 album.read。如果还要修改内容或分享原始文件，请勾选全部权限。密钥保存在钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the Immich web UI, open Account Settings > API Keys and create a new key with asset.read, asset.view, person.read and album.read. To copy or drag out originals, also add asset.download (without it, the large preview is used). The key is kept in the keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Immich 網頁的「帳號設定 > API 金鑰」建立新金鑰，權限勾選 asset.read、asset.view、person.read 和 album.read。想拷貝或拖出原始檔，再加 asset.download（沒有就用大預覽圖）。金鑰存在鑰匙圈裡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Immich 网页的“账户设置 > API 密钥”中创建新密钥，权限勾选 asset.read、asset.view、person.read 和 album.read。如果要拷贝或拖出原始文件，请再加上 asset.download（没有的话会使用大尺寸预览图）。密钥保存在钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
