          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server made the tag but didn’t add it to the photos. Refresh the library, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "伺服器建立了標籤，但沒有加到照片上。請重新整理圖庫後再試一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器创建了标签，但没有添加到照片上。请刷新图库后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server’s trash is turned off, so they are deleted for good." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "伺服器的垃圾桶已關閉，所以會永久刪除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器的废纸篓已关闭，因此会被永久删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to the server’s trash, which keeps them for 30 days unless the server is set otherwise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照片會移到伺服器的垃圾桶，除非伺服器另有設定，否則會保留 30 天。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照片会移到服务器的废纸篓，除非服务器另有设置，否则会保留 30 天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to the server’s trash, which keeps them for 30 days unless the server is set otherwise. ⌘Z puts them back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照片會移到伺服器的垃圾桶，除非伺服器另有設定，否則保留 30 天。按 ⌘Z 可以復原。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照片会移到服务器的废纸篓，除非服务器另有设置，否则会保留 30 天。按 ⌘Z 可以恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can’t be undone." : {
